===Symbol===
{{head|mul|symbols}}

# {{lb|mul|science}} The [[plus-minus sign]], indicating the [[tolerance]] or [[statistical]] [[margin of error]] of a quantity.
# {{lb|mul|mathematics}} Either value as a result of [[addition]] or [[subtraction]].
#: <math>ax^2+bx+c=0\rArr x=\frac{-b\plusmn\sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{2a}</math>.
# [[more or less|More or less]]
#* {{RQ:Schuster Hepaticae V|4}}
#*: (''b'') sporophyte with foot reduced, the entire sporophyte enveloped by the calyptra, which is '''±''' stipitate at the base.
# {{lb|mul|chess}} Advantage for white.

